---
// Hogwarts: four house banners lighting up in turn while it sorts.
---

<i class="h h1"></i>
<i class="h h2"></i>
<i class="h h3"></i>
<i class="h h4"></i>
<span class="star">SORTING…</span>

<style>
  .h {
    top: 38px;
    width: 34px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 4px 4px 17px 17px;
    opacity: 0.35;
    animation: house 4s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  .h1 {
    left: 22px;
    background: #c0504d;
  }
  .h2 {
    left: 64px;
    background: #d9a441;
    animation-delay: -1s;
  }
  .h3 {
    left: 106px;
    background: #4f7fc0;
    animation-delay: -2s;
  }
  .h4 {
    left: 148px;
    background: #5b9a6a;
    animation-delay: -3s;
    width: 30px;
  }
  .star {
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 98px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--pm);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
</style>
